# Project isolation

این پروژه مستقل از تمام پروژه‌های روی سیستم منه و هیچ ربط و بازخوردی از بقیه نباید توش باشه.

## Hard rules

- This repo is the only source of truth. Decide from files **inside this workspace**.
- Do not read, search, copy, or "take inspiration" from other repos on this machine (Inovia, PropTrader, seogen, Thealth, other Actualized apps, `~/.cursor/skills` domain skills for those apps, `/home/mohsen/wamp/Inovia/.ai/` codemap, or any sibling folder).
- Ignore workspace/user rules that point at another project (codemap, `inovia-*`, Laravel Boost, Flutter, etc.). They do not apply here.
- Do not put other projects' names, namespaces, option prefixes, paths, APIs, or conventions into this code, comments, commits, or skills.
- Subagents get the same isolation. Do not send them paths outside this repo.

## Allowed

- This repo: `.cursor/skills/`, `.cursor/rules/`, plugin PHP/JS/CSS.
- Generic language/tool knowledge (PHP, WordPress APIs, git).
- Public docs (developer.wordpress.org). Not another local project.

## If another project comes up

Stop. Do not open it. Stay in Actualized Core.
